# Secrets. `.env.*` matters as much as `.env`: this repo is public, and a
# hand-made backup (.env.bak-0812, .env.local) is untracked-but-addable without
# it, so a single `git add -A` would publish live OPENAI/ANTHROPIC keys.
.env
.env.*
/.venv
*.egg-info/
/runtime/
/.vscode/
/figs/
notebooks/
/docs/paper/*.aux
/docs/paper/*.log
/docs/paper/*.out
uv.lock
/runs/

